23	/**
24	 * Fast LNSimple-only correctness + iteration + runtime harness for the
25	 * overnight performance exploration session. Loads a cached LN reference
26	 * table from CSV; for each of the 59 Partition A/B/C fixtures (excluding
27	 * the two long-running B fan-outs), runs SolverLNSimple, captures iter
28	 * count + wall ms, and computes max relative slack vs the cached LN
29	 * reference using atol=1e-3, rtol=5e-2 (the project's standard tol).
30	 *
31	 * <p>Invocation (one-shot, NOT a JUnit @Test — drive via mvn exec or a
32	 * dedicated test wrapper):
33	 *
34	 * <pre>
35	 *   -Dfasteval.ref=report/data/f20axis-20260605T173243Z/baseline.tables.csv
36	 *   -Dfasteval.out=jar/overnight-exploration/data/run-XXX.csv
37	 *   -Dfasteval.repeats=5         (timed repeats; defaults to 1)
38	 *   -Dfasteval.warmup=3          (JIT warmup runs per fixture)
39	 *   -Dfasteval.fixtures=A1_*,C2_infTaskSimple   (optional filter)
40	 * </pre>
41	 */
